  "hints": [
    "Comparing every pair is O(n^2) and will time out on the stress case.",
    "A HashSet gives you have-I-seen-this in O(1).",
    "You do not even need a loop: a set built from the array has fewer elements than the array exactly when there was a duplicate."
  ],
  "complexity": "O(n) time, O(n) space",
